# `filters` JSON

The `filters` section defines the global filters added to a global filter panel widget, which is available in the dashboard designer.

## Global Filters Example

```nolang
"filters": [
    {
        "label": "Account.Type",
        "fields": [
            "Account.Type"
        ],
        "operator": "in",
        "locked": false,
        "dataset": {
            "name": "opportunity"
        },
        "value": [
            "Customer"
        ]
    },
    {
        "label": "ForecastCategory",
        "fields": [
            "ForecastCategory"
        ],
        "operator": "in",
        "locked": true,
        "dataset": {
            "name": "opportunity"
        },
        "value": [
            "BestCase"
        ]
    }
],
```

- **[filters Properties](/docs/analytics/bi-dev-guide-json/guide/bi-dbjson-filters-parameters.md)**

